      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "814．作出用数对集合给出的关系的图象：",
        "а) $\\{(x,y)\\mid x=2,\\ y\\text{ 是任意数}\\}$；",
        "б) $\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\text{ 是任意数},\\ y=3\\}$．",
        "这些关系中，哪些是函数？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "815",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "815．证明下列各式恒等：",
        "а) $3(a+4)-12(a+1)$ 与 $-9a$；",
        "б) $6b^2+1$ 与 $3b(3b+1)-(3b-1)$；",
        "в) $5(2x+4y-1)$ 与 $10(x-0.5)+20y$；",
        "г) $3(a^2+b^2)-(4-a^2-b^2)$ 与 $4(a^2+b^2-1)$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "816",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
